title: After a session ends the guest's workspace does not remember the shared folder (its copy is deleted, there is nothing to put back on the canvas)
folders: share-text
limit: 60
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
guest-expect-log: opening .*shared.*share-text
expect-file: {WORK}\data-guest\session.json :: (?s)^(?!.*data-guest\\\\shared).*"workspace"

wait 3000
share start
wait 9000
share stop
wait 6000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 9000
left files
wait 1200
mark after-the-session
wait 1500
quit
wait 1500
